window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-c7af5bbd57109077"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"codex-ide-extension\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"codex-ide\">Codex IDE 扩展</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code> 可获取对应 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"build-with-the-context-already-in-your-editor\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">在编辑器中直接使用已有上下文开发</h2> <p>让 Codex 与代码并排工作：把打开的文件和选区带入提示词，在原位置查看修改，并在不打断工作流的情况下把较长的任务交给云端处理。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：代码编辑器旁的交互式 Codex IDE 扩展</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"start-here\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_2\">从这里开始</h3> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=openai.chatgpt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">安装扩展（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-c7af5bbd57109077?anchor=getting-started\">扩展快速入门</a></li> </ul> <p><a id=\"why-use-codex-ide-extension\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"codex-ide_1\">为什么使用 Codex IDE 扩展</h3> <ul> <li><strong>直接使用已打开的上下文：</strong> 在输入框中引用打开的文件、选中的代码和最近的聊天。Codex 从你正在查看的代码开始工作，减少重复描述问题。</li> <li><strong>在代码旁审阅修改：</strong> 阅读摘要、检查聚焦的差异，并在同一聊天中继续追问。源代码和修改理由始终同时可见。</li> <li><strong>任务变大时委派：</strong> 快速迭代保留在本地；需要更多时间和空间时连接 Codex Web，之后仍可回到同一编辑器工作流审阅结果。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"getting-started\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">开始使用</h2> <p><strong>在 IDE 中开始使用。</strong></p> <p>安装或启用 Codex，登录，然后在编辑器保留上下文的情况下开始聊天。</p> <p><a id=\"1-install-or-enable-codex\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"1-codex\">1. 安装或启用 Codex</h3> <p>选择你的 IDE。VS Code 及兼容编辑器使用 Codex 扩展；Xcode 和 JetBrains IDE 提供各自的集成。</p> <ul> <li>Visual Studio Code（已阻止不安全链接）</li> <li>Cursor（已阻止不安全链接）</li> <li>Windsurf（已阻止不安全链接）</li> <li><a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=openai.chatgpt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visual Studio Code Insiders（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Xcode/setting-up-coding-intelligence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Xcode（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/help/ai-assistant/codex-agent.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">JetBrains IDE（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <p><a id=\"2-open-codex\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"2-codex\">2. 打开 Codex</h3> <p><strong>VS Code、Cursor 或 Windsurf：</strong> 选择 Codex 图标。如果图标不可见，打开命令面板并运行 <strong>Codex: Open Codex Sidebar</strong>。</p> <p><strong>Xcode：</strong> 打开编码助手，开始新聊天并选择 Codex 作为智能体。</p> <p><strong>JetBrains IDE：</strong> 打开 AI Chat 并选择 Codex。</p> <p><a id=\"3-start-your-first-chat\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"3\">3. 开始第一次聊天</h3> <p>打开一个项目，请 Codex 解释代码库、完成聚焦修改或帮助调试。任务前后创建 Git 检查点，以便需要时回退。</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-67a7ce1fea36da0d\">阅读最佳实践（官方来源暂不可用）</a></p> <p><a id=\"next-steps\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_4\">下一步</h3> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=use-editor-context\">使用编辑器上下文编写提示词</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-820e54e1b31b71d3\">探索 IDE 命令</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7969ca0198aaf47f\">配置扩展</a></li> </ul> <p><a id=\"see-what-codex-can-do-in-your-ide\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"codex-ide_2\">看看 Codex 在 IDE 中能做什么</h2> <p>让 Codex 留在代码旁边，解释、编辑、审阅并委派工作。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=use-editor-context\">使用已经打开的上下文</a>：把打开的文件、选区或最近聊天加入输入框，然后直接提问或编辑。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64\">在代码旁审阅修改</a>：在不打开额外导航窗格的情况下查看摘要和改动行，保留想要的编辑，并从同一视图继续追问。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-c302e8415c7f61ad?sectionMissing=delegate-from-the-ide-extension\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">任务变大时委派（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-c302e8415c7f61ad\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a>：快速动手时选择本地工作，需要较长任务时从 IDE 启动云端工作，之后返回结果。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"use-codex-ide-extension-when\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"codex-ide_3\">什么时候使用 Codex IDE 扩展？</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=use-editor-context\">进行聚焦修改</a>：让相关文件和 Codex 处于同一视图。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=use-editor-context\">学习陌生代码</a>：询问编辑器中已经打开的文件和符号。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64\">就地审阅修改</a>：在源代码旁检查并应用编辑。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-c302e8415c7f61ad?sectionMissing=delegate-from-the-ide-extension\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">委派较大任务（官网章节，需联网）</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-c302e8415c7f61ad\">本地页面（未识别该章节）</a>：从 IDE 启动云端工作，并回到结果处继续。</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"codex-ide-extension\">Codex IDE extension</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"build-with-the-context-already-in-your-editor\">Build with the context already in your editor</h2> <p>Work with Codex beside your code. Bring open files and selections into the prompt, review edits in place, and hand off longer work without breaking your flow.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: Interactive Codex IDE extension beside a code editor</p> </blockquote> <h3 id=\"start-here\">Start here</h3> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=openai.chatgpt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Install the extension (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-c7af5bbd57109077?anchor=getting-started\">Extension quickstart</a></li> </ul> <h3 id=\"why-use-codex-ide-extension\">Why use Codex IDE extension</h3> <ul> <li><strong>Use the context already open:</strong> Reference open files, selected code, and recent chats directly from the composer. Codex starts with the code you are already looking at, so you spend less time restating the problem.</li> <li><strong>Review changes beside your code:</strong> Read the summary, inspect a focused diff, and follow up in the same chat. Keep only the changes you want while the source and rationale stay visible together.</li> <li><strong>Delegate when the task grows:</strong> Keep quick iterations local, or connect Codex web when a task needs more time and room. Return to a reviewable result from the same editor workflow.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"getting-started\">Getting started</h2> <p><strong>Get started in your IDE.</strong></p> <p>Install or enable Codex, sign in, and start a chat with the context already open in your editor.</p> <h3 id=\"1-install-or-enable-codex\">1. Install or enable Codex</h3> <p>Choose your IDE. VS Code and compatible editors use the Codex extension; Xcode and JetBrains IDEs provide their own integrations.</p> <ul> <li>Visual Studio Code (blocked unsafe link)</li> <li>Cursor (blocked unsafe link)</li> <li>Windsurf (blocked unsafe link)</li> <li><a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=openai.chatgpt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visual Studio Code Insiders (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Xcode/setting-up-coding-intelligence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Xcode (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/help/ai-assistant/codex-agent.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">JetBrains IDEs (online)</a></li> </ul> <h3 id=\"2-open-codex\">2. Open Codex</h3> <p><strong>VS Code, Cursor, or Windsurf:</strong> choose the Codex icon. If it is not visible, open the Command Palette and run <strong>Codex: Open Codex Sidebar</strong>.</p> <p><strong>Xcode:</strong> open the coding assistant, start a new chat, and choose Codex as the agent.</p> <p><strong>JetBrains IDEs:</strong> open AI Chat and select Codex.</p> <h3 id=\"3-start-your-first-chat\">3. Start your first chat</h3> <p>Open a project and ask Codex to explain the codebase, make a focused change, or help you debug an issue. Create Git checkpoints before and after a task so you can revert changes.</p> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-67a7ce1fea36da0d\">Read the best practices (official source unavailable)</a></p> <h3 id=\"next-steps\">Next steps</h3> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=use-editor-context\">Prompt with editor context</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-820e54e1b31b71d3\">Explore IDE commands</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7969ca0198aaf47f\">Configure the extension</a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"see-what-codex-can-do-in-your-ide\">See what Codex can do in your IDE</h2> <p>Stay close to the code while Codex explains, edits, reviews, and delegates.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=use-editor-context\">Use the context already open</a>: Add an open file, a selection, or a recent chat to the composer, then ask Codex to explain or edit the code with that context already attached.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64\">Review changes beside your code</a>: Review a concise summary and the changed lines without an extra navigation pane. Inspect the two affected files, keep the edits you want, and ask for a follow-up from the same view.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-c302e8415c7f61ad?sectionMissing=delegate-from-the-ide-extension\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">Delegate when the task gets bigger (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-c302e8415c7f61ad\">Local page (section not recognized)</a>: Choose local work for fast, hands-on iteration, or connect Codex web to delegate a longer task. The chat stays available when you return to review the result.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"use-codex-ide-extension-when\">Use Codex IDE extension when…</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=use-editor-context\">You are making focused edits</a>: Keep the relevant files and Codex in the same view.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=use-editor-context\">You are learning unfamiliar code</a>: Ask about the files and symbols already open in the editor.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64\">You want to review changes in place</a>: Inspect and apply edits alongside the source.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-c302e8415c7f61ad?sectionMissing=delegate-from-the-ide-extension\" title=\"旧来源章节未在本地快照中定位，打开该文章；可通过官方来源查看当前章节。\">You want to delegate a larger task (official section, online)</a> <a href=\"#/article/a-c302e8415c7f61ad\">Local page (section not recognized)</a>: Start cloud work from the IDE and return to the result.</li> </ul>"};
